[00:30.87] Wish I was ocean size
[00:35.13] They cannot move you
[00:38.26] No one tries no one pulls you
[00:43.76] Out from your hole
[00:45.71] Like a tooth aching a jawbone...
[01:12.09] I was made with a heart of stone
[01:17.03] To be broken
[01:18.53] With one hard blow
[01:22.37] I've seen the ocean
[01:24.22] Break on the shore
[01:26.93] Come together with no harm done...
[01:36.34] It ain't easy living...
[01:41.23] I want to be
[01:44.29] As deep
[01:49.99] As the ocean
[01:54.49] Mother ocean
[02:58.66] Some people tell me
[03:00.46] Home is in the sky
[03:03.63] In the sky lives a spy
[03:08.94] I want to be more like the ocean
[03:14.04] No talking
[03:15.42] All action...
[03:18.67] No talking
[03:20.88] All action...
[03:22.20] 